{"completed": true, "response": "{\"sections\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"step\":\"新的一步\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"离开后由笃定转为空茫\"},{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"step\":\"往深处走\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"好日子也随离开失去\"},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"step\":\"往深处走\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"发现自己眷恋被接纳\"},{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"step\":\"新的一步\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"开始怀疑离开是否错了\"},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"step\":\"往深处走\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"争执耗尽后只剩难受\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"step\":\"往深处走\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"看清陪伴曾替他分担\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"step\":\"新的一步\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"孤单动摇了离开的决心\"},{\"sec\":\"S08\",\"step\":\"往深处走\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"看清回忆代替不了陪伴\"},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"step\":\"新的一步\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"开始追问想回去的动机\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"step\":\"往深处走\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"确认最舍不得的是归属\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"step\":\"新的一步\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"决定先把眼下过稳\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"step\":\"新的一步\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"能同时承认好与伤害\"},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"step\":\"新的一步\",\"back_to\":\"\",\"new\":\"把归属愿望转向未来\"}],\"loops\":[\"S02–S05 在“舍不得过去的好”和“不能忘记受过的气”之间来回，但逐渐从争辩走到纯粹的难受\",\"S06–S10 在“怀念被陪伴的温暖”和“害怕以后独自承担”之间来回，但不断追到更具体的核心：他真正舍不得的是被当作自己人的归属感\"],\"verdict\":\"整体像往前探索，中段虽有明显来回摆动，但每次反复都带出更具体的认识，后段则连续形成新的选择。\",\"score\":9}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8a8e926a-57d7-460a-8cb8-0d27975e4017", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T070532251585Z", "elapsed_seconds": 19.907, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:05:52.162588+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "373bbd02ccaea23a3eb4800ae5ad9be078e96d69db08